<<<
senses: (A) imperious or commanding or strong-willed, & (B) skilful or expert or practised. The DIFFER- ENTIATION is now complete, -ful having the A & -ly the B meanings; & disregard
===
senses: (A) imperious or commanding or strong-willed, & (B) skilful or expert or practised. The ^^DIFFERENTIATION^^ is now complete, *-ful* having the A & *-ly* the B meanings; & disregard
>>>

